+    `s_j = (t · (P_sum %ₘ (X^N + 1))_j + Q/2) % Q` (with `y_j = s_j = 0` for `j ≥ N`).
+  - **Witness + `Q = 31, t = 4` `Hole B` Falsifier Tooth**: `hoistedRescaleCert_witness_N2`
